<section class="route workspace-overview" data-route-view data-route-key="<%= page.route.key %>">
  <% if (page.accessNotice) { %><output class="toast" data-access-notice><%= page.accessNotice %></output><% } %>
  <header class="workspace-welcome"><span class="cortex-eyebrow">YOUR TRADING WORKSPACE</span><h1>Make your next move<br>an informed one.</h1><p>Connect your accounts, give your agents a research objective, and review the evidence before acting.</p><div class="workspace-actions"><a class="btn btn-solid" href="/research" data-nav-link>Start research ↗</a><a class="btn" href="/brain" data-nav-link>Explore the brain</a></div></header>
  <div class="workspace-section-title"><h2>Ready when you are</h2><span data-overview-status>Checking your setup…</span></div>
  <ol class="setup-steps">
    <li><span>01</span><div><h3>Connect your tools</h3><p>Save Gemini, OpenAI, or Claude credentials and connect Robinhood in one place.</p><small data-overview-providers>Checking providers…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/settings" data-nav-link>Open setup ↗</a></li>
    <li><span>02</span><div><h3>Build your research</h3><p>Add a playbook, supply market context, and let the agents plan, research, and challenge a thesis.</p><small data-overview-research>Checking saved research…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/research" data-nav-link>Research ↗</a></li>
    <li><span>03</span><div><h3>Review & act</h3><p>Inspect the exact broker request before approving it. Record the outcome in your journal.</p><small data-overview-broker>Checking account connection…</small></div><a class="btn" href="/accounts" data-nav-link>Accounts ↗</a></li>
  </ol>
  <div class="workspace-overview-foot"><p data-overview-lock>Exploring the workspace uses no AI tokens.</p><a href="/journal" data-nav-link>Open your journal ↗</a></div>
</section>
